<p>Pukaari zainabe muztar hussain (a.s) aa jaao<br />
mere ghareeb baraadar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>Jo tum nahi'n to nahi'n koi poochne waala<br />
dilo'n pa chalte hai qanjar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>nahi'n hai taab sakina me ab tamaacho'n ki<br />
Sulaalo seene pa aakar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>Wo nanhe hatho'n me daaman phata hua le kar<br />
Sakina kehti hai rokar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>Tumhare baad to touqeer ho gayi bhayya<br />
saro'n se chin gayi chaadar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>mai qaide shaam ke haalaat kya kahu'n bhayya<br />
akeli soti hai dukhtar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>jo tum nahi'n to watan jaake kya karu'n bhayya<br />
Mai phir ke aayi hoo dar dar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>Hamei'n sawaar kare koun kya qayamat hai<br />
Nahi hai q(a.s)im o akber hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>Bulaalo saath me abbas ko bhi ae bhayya<br />
haram ki chinti hai chaadar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

<p>Na mehmilei'n na amaari hai na kajaawe hai<br />
chale hai leke sitamgar hussain (a.s) aa jaao</p>

